[!linux] skip 'recorded on linux'

# Things listed in decisions.yml are ignored or snoozed; the rest is a candidate. Watch patterns come from homebot.yml.
# exit: 0
exec homebot inventory
cmpwork stdout inventory.stdout
# exit: 0
exec homebot
cmpwork stdout inbox.stdout
-- home/.home/homebot.yml --
profiles:
  default: workstation
triage:
  watch:
    - ~/.config/*
    - ~/.*
    - ~/projects/*
-- home/.home/decisions.yml --
ignore:
  - ~/.bashrc
  - ~/.config/noisy
-- home/.bashrc --
mine
-- home/.zshrc --
mine
-- home/.config/noisy/a --
x
-- home/.config/wanted/b --
x
-- home/projects/p1/readme --
x
-- inventory.stdout --
homebot inventory · testhost (linux) · ~/.home
  Profile   workstation · never unpacked here
  Links     0 ok, 0 to fix, 0 blocked, 0 locked
  Secrets   no keys yet (homebot keys init)
  Triage    3 to sort, 2 ignored
  Repo      not a git repository
  Exports   none configured
  Helper    not installed (homebot setup)
-- inbox.stdout --
homebot · testhost · 5 things need you (1 urgent)

  1  ! ~/.home is not a git repository
       → git -C ~/.home init
  2  • Secrets are not set up yet
       → homebot keys init
  3  • 3 new things to sort: track, ignore or snooze
       ~/.config/wanted, ~/.zshrc, ~/projects/p1
       → homebot triage
  4  • Profile workstation does not exist yet
       Write the steps that set up this machine
       → $EDITOR ~/.home/manifests/profiles/workstation.yml
  5  • The background helper is not installed
       It seals, exports, links and reminds you every hour
       → homebot setup
